    <!-- LOOKING FOR A PSYCHOLOGIST IN FAMAGUSTA -->
    <section id="famagusta" class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-warm">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-5 lg:px-8">
        <div class="text-center mb-14">
          <span class="inline-block text-xs font-medium text-primary bg-primary/10 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-4">Famagusta</span>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl lg:text-4xl text-ink mb-4">What people wonder before booking</h2>
          <p class="text-ink-muted text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto">Deciding to work with a psychologist is often the hardest step. In a city like Famagusta, where everyone seems to know everyone, a few more questions come with it. Here are the ones we hear most, answered plainly.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-5">

          <div class="bg-white border border-warm-tertiary rounded-2xl p-7">
            <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-ink mb-3">&ldquo;Will I run into someone I know?&rdquo;</h3>
            <p class="text-ink-muted text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">
              It is completely understandable for this concern to come to mind when you live in a small city. At our centre, sessions and your personal information are protected in line with confidentiality principles.
            </p>
            <p class="text-ink-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
              If coming to the centre is not comfortable for you, you can continue the same process through <a href="/en/services/online-therapy.html" class="text-primary underline hover:no-underline">online sessions</a>.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white border border-warm-tertiary rounded-2xl p-7">
            <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-ink mb-3">&ldquo;Turkish or English?&rdquo;</h3>
            <p class="text-ink-muted text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">
              You can have your sessions in Turkish or in English. English sessions are held directly with the psychologist, not through an interpreter.
            </p>
            <p class="text-ink-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
              For <a href="/en/services/student-counselling.html" class="text-primary underline hover:no-underline">international students</a> newly arrived on the island and for individuals from abroad, this removes the language distance in between.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white border border-warm-tertiary rounded-2xl p-7">
            <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-ink mb-3">&ldquo;A psychologist or a psychiatrist?&rdquo;</h3>
            <p class="text-ink-muted text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">
              A psychologist does not prescribe medication; they carry out talk-based therapy. When a situation calls for a medication assessment, your psychologist says so openly and refers you to the psychiatrists we work with.
            </p>
            <p class="text-ink-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
              We have <a href="/en/blog/psychologist-or-psychiatrist.html" class="text-primary underline hover:no-underline">written about the difference in detail</a>.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white border border-warm-tertiary rounded-2xl p-7">
            <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-ink mb-3">&ldquo;I find it hard to come to the centre.&rdquo;</h3>
            <p class="text-ink-muted text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">
              Whether you live in Famagusta or are coming from Nicosia, Kyrenia, İskele or from off the island, if for any reason you find it hard to come to the centre, you can use the <a href="/en/services/online-therapy.html" class="text-primary underline hover:no-underline">online session</a> option.
            </p>
            <p class="text-ink-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Sessions are held over a secure video call. An online session is also 45 minutes and follows the same process as an in-person one.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white border border-warm-tertiary rounded-2xl p-7">
            <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-ink mb-3">&ldquo;What happens in the first session?&rdquo;</h3>
            <p class="text-ink-muted text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">
              In the first meeting we focus on getting to know you and on understanding what brought you here and what you need.
            </p>
            <p class="text-ink-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
              You do not have to tell everything in that first session, or arrive at a solution right away; the process takes shape together.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white border border-warm-tertiary rounded-2xl p-7">
            <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-ink mb-3">&ldquo;How long will I need to come to therapy?&rdquo;</h3>
            <p class="text-ink-muted text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">
              The length of therapy is not the same for everyone. It depends on your needs, on what we are working on and on how the process moves along.
            </p>
            <p class="text-ink-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
              At the start we set our goals together, and we revisit them as time goes on.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

        <div class="text-center mt-12">
          <a href="/en/therapy-process.html" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary font-medium hover:gap-3 transition-all">
            What happens after the first session?
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

