              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-accent/10 flex items-center justify-center text-lg mb-3">🌍</div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-ink text-sm mb-1.5">Turkish &amp; English</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">You can have your sessions in Turkish or in English.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 border border-warm-tertiary">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-sage/30 flex items-center justify-center text-lg mb-3">📋</div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-ink text-sm mb-1.5">Evidence-Based</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">We work with methods that have been researched, such as CBT and psychodynamic therapy.</p>
